 "note": "Mixed page. Lines 1-44 are the Lunenburg High School staff list: the page prints no school name above it, but Michael Barney is the Principal (the 2002 book, p39, prints the same administration block under 'HIGH SCHOOL'), and the departments are high-school ones (Industrial Technology, Guidance, Director of Athletics); the next section begins 'TURKEY HILL MIDDLE SCHOOL' at line 45, so this list is not Turkey Hill's. Three columns, assigned by Textract x-position (0.10 / 0.38 / 0.66). Line 20's 'Greenhouse Manager' is the wrapped continuation of Joanne McQuaid's title on line 19. Lines 40-41 'ALTERNATIVE EDUCATION / PROGRAM' is one heading on two lines. Peter McCauliff is printed twice, under Social Studies (line 25) and Computer Science (line 26); both recorded. Line 45 is the Turkey Hill section title and line 46 its byline (Keith Hochstein, Principal), treated as headings; lines 47-53 are that school's narrative, 54 the page number. Honorifics printed before names (Mr., Mrs., Ms., Dr.) are not carried in `name`."
